  "description": "Silverback is a powerful, elegant, and feature-rich message bus for .NET, designed to simplify asynchronous messaging, event-driven architectures, and microservice communication. With seamless integration for Apache Kafka and MQTT, it offers robust features for reliability, consistency, and scalability. This core package provides the basic in-memory message bus.",
